## This repository (Starforge Universe)

Site-specific product and routing conventions for **this** codebase. When copying the design language elsewhere, leave this section behind or replace it with the target product’s IA.

- Brand name: **Starforge Universe**.
- Catalog source of truth: [`src/app/data/product-lines.ts`](src/app/data/product-lines.ts). Extend by catalog entry only.
- Routes: home `''`; product detail `/lines/:slug`; unknown slug → in-page missing state; unknown path → 404. Use `routerLink` / `Router` + `withViewTransitions()`.
- Sticky nav mega pane: nested catalog `products` / `children` / `composedOf`; **Coming soon** when empty. Contact mega pane → `mailto:star.forge.worker@starforge-universe.com` (not a product line).
- Home section order: Hero → Introduction → Product lines → Closing.
- Hero implementation: [`hero-sphere.canvas.ts`](src/app/components/home/hero-sphere.canvas.ts) + CSS `.hero__planet`; 15s solid / 5s wireframe; logical canvas size for DPR.
